  "body": "@mikewest \r\n\r\nhttps://mikewest.github.io/corpp/#corp-check uses a [reserved client](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-reserved-client), but on [navigation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#process-a-navigate-fetch) it is always a new environment and hence the embber policy is not set. Mike, can you tell me why it is needed? I thought https://mikewest.github.io/corpp/#process-navigation-response (for nested frames) and browsing context group assignment (for toplevel frames) would be enough.",
